MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The longer HDMI cable feels useful because I have bought display cables and cable organizers; extra reach could help connect my computer or Raspberry Pi around my desk.",
    "The SATA SSD connects with my interest in computer hardware upgrades, although I would need to confirm compatibility and whether I need that much storage."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Streaming sticks and Alexa devices do not solve the connectivity, organization, and maintenance needs reflected in my recent purchases. Owning a Raspberry Pi does not mean I currently want another TV device.",
    "The 16TB external drive offers storage, but my memory-card purchases do not establish a need for that capacity. The SSD also remains a possibility to investigate rather than an immediate choice."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in electronics seems to have been stretched into an interest in smart speakers, smart displays, and home automation without a clear connection to what I am doing.",
    "My Amazon-branded accessory purchases seem to have been treated as interest in other Amazon devices, even though I chose those accessories for specific practical uses."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Ethernet adapter, network cables, headphone mount, and electric duster suggest that improving and maintaining an existing computer setup matters to me right now.",
    "Specific fit matters: cable length and routing can make an accessory useful, while storage capacity and hardware compatibility determine whether a drive makes sense."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my interest in computer accessories but stretched it too far into smart-home and entertainment devices instead of focusing on practical improvements to my existing setup."
}
